    {
      "source": "A simple default <a href=\"EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> returning a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/support/StandardEvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.support\"><code>StandardEvaluationContext</code></a> with the given\nroot object.",
